The  Promiscuous  authentication  service module for PAM provides
functionality for all the PAM categories: authentication, account
management, session management and password management.  In terms
of the parameter, these are the and  features.   The  Promiscuous
module  will  universally allow all requests.  It is primarily of
use during testing, and to silence PAM‐enabled applications.  The
following options may be passed to the module: debugging informa‐
tion at level.
